WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.288 --> 00:00:03.270
- [Voiceover] We're back,
and we're sitting on stools.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.332
(laughing) Tonight we're
joined by the cast of

00:00:05.332 --> 00:00:07.723
what I consider to be the
funniest show on television,

00:00:07.723 --> 00:00:09.085
Silicon Valley.

00:00:09.085 --> 00:00:12.702
Please welcome Zach
Woods, Thomas Middleditch,

00:00:12.702 --> 00:00:14.939
Kumail Nanijani, and Amanda Crew.

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:19.106
(audience applauding)
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:38.071
Wow you're wearing the pied piper jackets.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.254
- [Voiceover] Everyone
on stage is wearing wool.

00:00:40.254 --> 00:00:42.833
- [Voiceover] You're in an
incredibly hot auditorium

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:45.701
wearing wool, and those look awful.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:47.285
They look absolutely terrible.

00:00:47.285 --> 00:00:48.655
- [Voiceover] Thank you so much.

00:00:48.655 --> 00:00:50.165
- They're also incredibly hot,

00:00:50.165 --> 00:00:51.511
so I smell like Ellis Island.

00:00:51.511 --> 00:00:54.761
(laughing)

00:00:54.761 --> 00:00:55.775
- [Voiceover] Now wait,
you've maintained that because

00:00:55.775 --> 00:00:57.811
there's an episode of the show obviously

00:00:57.811 --> 00:01:01.046
where these jackets debut and
they become chick magnets,

00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:04.834
you have maintained that you
think you look pretty good

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:06.364
in this jacket in real life.

00:01:06.364 --> 00:01:07.679
- [Voiceover] I definitely
like this jacket,

00:01:07.679 --> 00:01:11.050
and objectively I know it's an ugly thing,

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:15.217
but I love it.
(everyone laughing)

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.673
Just so you know it's
got everything for it.

00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:20.326
Rats.
- [Host] Rats?

00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:21.675
- [Voiceover] Upon the sleeve.

00:01:21.675 --> 00:01:22.639
- [Voiceover] What number are we?

00:01:22.639 --> 00:01:24.220
We're number one.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:28.387
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:29.782 --> 00:01:32.550
You'll note that every
letter is a different color?

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.507
- [Host] Yeah.

00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:34.951
- [Voiceover] It's truly terrible.

00:01:34.951 --> 00:01:36.383
- [Host] It's the worst idea ever.

00:01:36.383 --> 00:01:40.828
If you've ever had a fantasy
about being a NASCAR,

00:01:40.828 --> 00:01:42.156
you're doing it right now.

00:01:42.156 --> 00:01:44.884
- [Voiceover] Well, it's
kind of -- I think --

00:01:44.884 --> 00:01:49.179
based on our terrible
decision to make jackets

00:01:49.179 --> 00:01:51.198
for ourselves in real life,

00:01:51.198 --> 00:01:53.643
we all decided that it
would be a pretty cool thing

00:01:53.643 --> 00:01:55.990
if the cast like worse
jackets for ourselves,

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.449
wore them around the lot and

00:01:57.449 --> 00:02:00.182
we'd call ourselves The
Rude Boys' Lot on the studio

00:02:00.182 --> 00:02:01.490
Sony Pictures Lot,

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.221
and we think the writers were like,

00:02:03.221 --> 00:02:06.354
"Not on our watch."
(audience laughing)

00:02:06.354 --> 00:02:07.578
But put this into the show.

00:02:07.578 --> 00:02:08.682
- [Host] Just to humiliate
you as much as possible.

00:02:08.682 --> 00:02:10.418
- [Voiceover] To take us down a peg.

00:02:10.418 --> 00:02:11.989
- [Voiceover] The quality of ours is like

00:02:11.989 --> 00:02:13.304
made out of sweatshirt,

00:02:13.304 --> 00:02:14.918
and then this is like silk line.

00:02:14.918 --> 00:02:17.874
We made shitty ones, they
make really nices ones.

00:02:17.874 --> 00:02:18.969
- [Host] Those are gorgeous though.

00:02:18.969 --> 00:02:20.969
Congratulations.

